  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.032583,
      "end": 5.365207,
      "text": "picachu helps borrowers on Solana decide how much to\nrepay and how much cash to keep."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.507125,
      "end": 9.890666,
      "text": "Use a limited budget to reduce risk while preserving\nfunds for other needs."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.020999999999999,
      "end": 12.40225,
      "text": "This walkthrough covers the complete planner,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.590458,
      "end": 14.948541,
      "text": "allocation when funds are insufficient,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.113624999999999,
      "end": 18.085083,
      "text": "and a verified repayment receipt on the test network."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.73399966666667,
      "end": 24.263332666666667,
      "text": "First, select the loans to include. This labeled\nsynthetic example has debts of sixty-five,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.38212466666667,
      "end": 30.180749666666667,
      "text": "fifty-five, and forty-five USDC. Each has one SOL of\ncollateral at an"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.180749666666667,
      "end": 35.60899966666667,
      "text": "assumed price of one hundred dollars. Connecting a\nwallet loads supported Kamino Devnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.60899966666667,
      "end": 38.44158266666667,
      "text": "positions. The wallet balance is shared,"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.58349966666667,
      "end": 41.311915666666664,
      "text": "rather than counted once for every position."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.88766666666667,
      "end": 45.252707666666666,
      "text": "Next, the example wallet holds eighty USDC."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.556666666666665,
      "end": 51.213332666666666,
      "text": "Keep twenty, repay at most thirty, and test a thirty\npercent fall in SOL's price."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.355291666666666,
      "end": 56.15545766666666,
      "text": "The target is an additional five percent price buffer\nafter that fall, before liquidation."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.285832666666664,
      "end": 60.00962366666667,
      "text": "The budget is a limit, not a requirement to spend\neverything."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.13999966666667,
      "end": 63.215623666666666,
      "text": "This is a chosen scenario, not a market forecast."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.821,
      "end": 68.192958,
      "text": "Loan A needs eleven point eight USDC, loan B one point\neight,"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.439083,
      "end": 73.80637399999999,
      "text": "and loan C no extra repayment. The total, thirteen point\nsix, is below the budget,"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.93674999999999,
      "end": 76.22533299999999,
      "text": "leaving sixty-six point four in the wallet."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.367333,
      "end": 79.315666,
      "text": "Each row shows its repayment and scenario buffer."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.469166,
      "end": 83.505458,
      "text": "The core uses the example's liquidation threshold and\nborrowing factor;"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.763166,
      "end": 85.82025,
      "text": "AI does not invent these amounts."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.43258300000001,
      "end": 90.41104100000001,
      "text": "You can write: repay up to ten USDC, keep twenty,"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.59925000000001,
      "end": 96.660999,
      "text": "if SOL falls thirty percent. picachu creates a draft for\nreview and explicit application."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.802958,
      "end": 100.480457,
      "text": "AI can extract the goal, while the core validates its\nvalues."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.622416,
      "end": 104.959624,
      "text": "If fixed rules are used instead, the interface\nidentifies that source."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.101583,
      "end": 108.54762400000001,
      "text": "AI cannot decide the allocation or sign a transaction."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.13258300000001,
      "end": 113.504541,
      "text": "Ten dollars is three point six USDC short of meeting\nevery goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.6465,
      "end": 117.53229100000001,
      "text": "The warning remains: partial payment is not full\nprotection."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.662666,
      "end": 123.73604100000001,
      "text": "Explore allocation to compare repayments that reduce\nestimated liquidation costs in this scenario."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.877958,
      "end": 126.45595700000001,
      "text": "You can still increase the budget or change the goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.06591633333335,
      "end": 130.33833233333334,
      "text": "The model proposes about nine USDC for A,"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.52658333333335,
      "end": 134.58604133333336,
      "text": "leaving nearly one dollar unused. The exact amount is\nvisible."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.71637433333333,
      "end": 139.15779133333334,
      "text": "A still lacks the five percent target buffer, so this\nremains partial improvement."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.29970833333334,
      "end": 144.62074933333335,
      "text": "The explanation separates loss from one assumed\nliquidation event and repayment fees."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.75112433333334,
      "end": 148.60220833333335,
      "text": "Compare no repayment, equal split, risk-first repayment,"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.77887433333336,
      "end": 151.25266533333334,
      "text": "and the proposal using the same data and budget."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.39462433333335,
      "end": 155.60454033333335,
      "text": "The lowest cost among these candidates is different from\nmeeting every goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.72333333333336,
      "end": 158.64854133333336,
      "text": "Repayment principal is not liquidation loss."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.23333333333335,
      "end": 163.53370733333335,
      "text": "Review the amount, fee, and expiry, then sign with your\nwallet."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.66408333333334,
      "end": 169.52908233333335,
      "text": "Plan changes require another review. Each step opens\nonly after the previous receipt is verified."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.64787433333333,
      "end": 172.74666633333334,
      "text": "The journal preserves progress across reloads."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.84233333333336,
      "end": 176.78599933333334,
      "text": "An uncertain status blocks further sending until\nchecked,"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.90483333333336,
      "end": 180.55916633333334,
      "text": "avoiding blind retries. Your wallet keeps the private\nkey."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.68954133333335,
      "end": 185.04987433333335,
      "text": "This is a workflow explanation, not footage of a Phantom\nconfirmation popup."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.66591633333334,
      "end": 190.55870733333336,
      "text": "This real receipt comes from a separate Vercel API test\nwith a dedicated Devnet wallet."
    },
    {
      "start": 190.70066633333334,
      "end": 193.90362433333337,
      "text": "The budget and reserve were each one USDC,"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.03399933333336,
      "end": 196.51933333333335,
      "text": "with a forty-five percent SOL scenario."
    },
    {
      "start": 196.62658333333334,
      "end": 201.31104033333335,
      "text": "After reviewing the new preview, the wallet repaid about\nzero point seven eight;"
    },
    {
      "start": 201.34879133333337,
      "end": 204.79483233333335,
      "text": "the full amount is shown. The journal verified the step."
    },
    {
      "start": 204.92516633333335,
      "end": 208.68370833333336,
      "text": "About sixteen point six two remained, above the reserve."
    },
    {
      "start": 208.80249933333334,
      "end": 212.42212433333336,
      "text": "A successful receipt does not mean every current goal is\nmet;"
    },
    {
      "start": 212.57566633333334,
      "end": 214.62120733333336,
      "text": "prices and interest can change."
    },
    {
      "start": 215.232583,
      "end": 220.16008300000001,
      "text": "The model matched twenty-five cases against the Kamino\nDevnet executable."
    },
    {
      "start": 220.27887500000003,
      "end": 224.14158300000003,
      "text": "Unsupported versions or configurations disable\nallocation."
    },
    {
      "start": 224.260375,
      "end": 227.706374,
      "text": "It finds the best result in a finite grid for one event,"
    },
    {
      "start": 227.84833300000003,
      "end": 231.65316600000003,
      "text": "without predicting probabilities or cascading\nliquidations."
    },
    {
      "start": 231.79508300000003,
      "end": 234.974916,
      "text": "picachu supports one wallet and up to three SOL"
    },
    {
      "start": 235.09370800000002,
      "end": 238.991124,
      "text": "and USDC loans. Try the planner, choose your goal,"
    },
    {
      "start": 239.15620800000002,
      "end": 241.838333,
      "text": "and inspect the source and evidence on GitHub."
    }
  ]
}
